      <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/download/">Download</a><a class="active" href="/markets/">EA Bot Market</a><a href="/create-trade-account/">Trade Account</a><a href="/contact/">Contact Us</a><a href="/about/">About Us</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header><main><section class="reb-hero"><div class="reb-hero-inner"><div><div class="reb-kicker">Forex Trading</div><h1>Forex Trading Automation</h1><p>Automate major, minor, and selected exotic currency pairs with structured entry logic, risk limits, and real-time MT5 monitoring.</p><div class="reb-hero-actions"><a class="reb-btn gold" href="/download/"><i class="fas fa-download reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0 5-5m-5 5-5-5M5 20h14"/></svg></i> Download Bot</a><a class="reb-btn dark" href="/contact/"><i class="fas fa-phone reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M7.2 3.5 10 8 7.8 10c1.2 2.7 3.4 4.9 6.2 6.2l2-2.2 4.5 2.8-.8 3.1c-.3 1-1.3 1.7-2.4 1.5C9.7 20.1 3.9 14.3 2.6 6.7c-.2-1.1.5-2.1 1.5-2.4l3.1-.8Z"/></svg></i> Contact Support</a></div></div><div class="reb-hero-card reb-standard-hero-frame reb-standard-hero-stats reb-standard-hero-stats"><img class="reb-standard-hero-robot" src="/assets/images/resource/reb-robot.png" alt="ReachEmpireBot"><div class="reb-mini-grid"><div class="reb-mini"><strong>MT5</strong><span>Integration</span></div><div class="reb-mini"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Monitoring</span></div><div class="reb-mini"><strong>Risk</strong><span>Control</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="reb-section"><div class="reb-section-title"><span>Forex Trading Details</span><h2>Bot Features and Supported Symbols</h2><p>Supported symbols: EURUSD, GBPUSD, USDJPY, AUDUSD, USDCAD and other broker-supported Forex pairs.</p></div><div class="reb-grid"><article class="reb-card"><i class="fas fa-coins reb-icon reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="9" cy="6" rx="6" ry="3"/><path d="M3 6v4c0 1.7 2.7 3 6 3s6-1.3 6-3V6M3 10v4c0 1.7 2.7 3 6 3 1 0 2-.1 2.8-.4M13 10c.6-1.2 2.7-2 5.2-2 3.2 0 5.8 1.3 5.8 3s-2.6 3-5.8 3c-2.5 0-4.6-.8-5.2-2Z" transform="scale(.86)"/></svg></i><h3>Core Features</h3><ul class="reb-list"><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Auto Buy & Sell execution</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>New candle / cooldown control</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Spread protection</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Smart risk management</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>24/7 MT5 monitoring</li></ul><a class="reb-btn gold" href="/contact/">Start Forex Trading</a></article><article class="reb-card"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt reb-icon reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2 20 5v6c0 5.2-3.4 9-8 11-4.6-2-8-5.8-8-11V5l8-3Z"/><path d="M12 7v10M8 12h8"/></svg></i><h3>Risk Control</h3><p>Designed for disciplined automation with lot size control, max position limits, spread filters, and monitoring rules before execution.</p><ul class="reb-list"><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Lot and exposure settings</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Spread / volatility protection</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Manual control option</li></ul></article><article class="reb-card"><i class="fas fa-desktop reb-icon reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8m-4-4v4"/></svg></i><h3>MT5 Operation</h3><p>Connect the bot with MetaTrader 5, select symbols, configure strategy settings, and track active positions from the dashboard.</p><ul class="reb-list"><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Symbol selection</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Live position tracking</li><li><i class="fas fa-check reb-inline-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></i>Bot status display</li></ul></article></div></section><section class="reb-section alt"><div class="reb-plan"><div class="reb-panel"><h3>Recommended Setup</h3><table class="reb-table"><tr><td>Best for</td><td>Currency pair trading</td></tr><tr><td>Main symbols</td><td>EURUSD / GBPUSD / USDJPY</td></tr><tr><td>Risk focus</td><td>Spread and lot control</td></tr><tr><td>Mode</td><td>MT5 Forex automation</td></tr></table></div><div class="reb-panel"><h3>Before You Start</h3><p style="color:#666;line-height:1.7">Prepare your MT5 account, confirm the symbols are available from your broker, test settings on demo first, and contact support before running high lot size or high position count.</p><a class="reb-btn gold" href="/markets-details/">Back to Markets</a></div></div></section></main><script id="reb-logo-route-fix">
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){
  document.querySelectorAll('img').forEach(function(img){
    var s = img.getAttribute('src') || '';
    if(s.indexOf('assets/images/logo') !== -1){
      img.onerror = function(){
        this.onerror = null;
        this.src = './assets/images/logo.png';
      };
    }
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(function(a){
    var h = (a.getAttribute('href') || '').replace(/^\//,'').replace(/\/$/,'').toLowerCase();
    if(h === 'login') a.setAttribute('href','/login/');
    if(h === 'signup') a.setAttribute('href','/signup/');
  });
});
</script>


<script id="reb-vercel-final-fallback">
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
  document.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(function(a){
    var h=(a.getAttribute('href')||'').replace(/^\//,'').replace(/\/$/,'').toLowerCase();
    if(h==='signup') a.setAttribute('href','/signup/');
    if(h==='login') a.setAttribute('href','/login/');
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('img').forEach(function(img){
    var s=img.getAttribute('src')||'';
    if(s.indexOf('logo')!==-1){
      img.onerror=function(){this.onerror=null;this.src='/assets/images/logo.png';};
    }
  });
});
</script>

